DESCRIPTION:Gravitate back to Morehead Planetarium for Star Families!\n\n \
 n\nMany of the constellations we can see in our night sky appear as charac
 ters in Greek myths. In this immersive planetarium experience\, you'll hea
 r tales of monsters\, animals\, gods\, heroes\, and princesses while learn
 ing to identify the associated constellations.\n\n \n\nStar Families is a 
 special series that provides a family-friendly planetarium experience. Arr
 ive before your show or stay after to journey through Morehead's interacti
 ve exhibits\, science demo spaces\, and Cosmic Goods gift shop.\n\n \n\nTh
 is program is recommended for families and children ages 7+.
