DESCRIPTION:Bigger and better\n\nThis year\, FallFest spreads out across th
 e heart of campus on Sunday\, August 16th from 6:30-9:30 p.m.– the Carol
 ina Union\, Davis Library\, Lenoir Dining Hall\, and the Pit – putting y
 ou right in the center of it all. It’s the perfect spot to soak up the e
 nergy before classes kick off the next day. Expect all the excitement and 
 Carolina spirit that made last year unforgettable.
