DESCRIPTION:We’re celebrating all things global at Carolina with the Glob
 al Whistle-Stop Tour! Come to the FedEx Global Education Center to meet pe
 ople\, play games and win prizes.\n\n \n\nThursday\, Aug. 20\n2 – 4 p.m.
 \nFedEx Global Education Center\, Florence and James Peacock Atrium\n\n \n
 \nIn the atrium\, grab a ticket and visit each station to discover upcomin
 g global events\, programs\, courses and other opportunities. It’s all p
 art of Carolina’s Global Guarantee\, our promise that a global education
  is available to all students. Plus\, enjoy some:\n\n \n\n🍦 LocoPops po
 psicles\n🧋 Bubble tea\n\n \n\nThis event is hosted by UNC Global Affair
 s and the UNC Study Abroad Office and co-sponsored by the Curriculum in Gl
 obal Studies\, Honors Carolina Global\, International Student and Scholar 
 Services\, Kenan-Flagler Undergraduate Business Global Programs\, INSITE A
 frica\, INSITE Asia\, INSITE Europe\, INSITE Latin America and the Caribbe
 an and INSITE Middle East.
GEO:35.907828;-79.054177
LOCATION:FedEx Global Education Center\, Florence and James Peacock Atrium
SUMMARY:Global Whistle-Stop Tour
