DESCRIPTION:Innovate Carolina is excited to feature Hao Dinh\, founder of G
 row by Design\, to present the first of three workshops in a series of dev
 eloping your skills utilizing AI in your workflow.\n\n \n\nForward Deploye
 d Engineering (FDE) has rapidly become the hottest job in the AI revolutio
 n\, and a new breed\, the AI-Augmented FDE\, is redefining who gets to par
 ticipate in the future of technology. AI-Augmented FDEs sit at the interse
 ction of customer impact\, rapid prototyping\, and applied AI\; they're th
 e people who turn messy\, real-world problems into working solutions at hi
 gh speed\, using AI as their build partner.\n\n \n\nThis high-energy\, han
 ds-on 90-minute workshop proves that you don't need deep AI expertise or t
 raditional tech credentials to break into this field. In an era where AI h
 andles the heavy lifting\, human skills\, curiosity\, empathy\, problem-so
 lving\, communication\, are the real advantage.\n\n \n\nParticipants will 
 step directly into the role of an AI-Augmented FDE: uncover a real custome
 r problem\, build a working prototype using accessible AI-powered tools\, 
 and iterate based on live feedback. By the end\, you'll understand the AI-
 Augmented FDE mindset\, experience the thrill of rapid delivery\, and walk
  away with a clear\, confidence-building path into one of the most in-dema
 nd roles in the AI industry.\n\n \n\nCheck out an exciting video teaser HE
 RE!\n\nFree and Open to All: Register HERE\n\n*This is event #1 in a three
 -event series. Stay tuned for parts two and three!
GEO:35.914361;-79.054904
LOCATION:Innovate Carolina Junction\, 50/51
SUMMARY:Become an AI Augmented Forward Deployed Engineer
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/become-an-ai-augmented-forward
 -deployed-engineer-3764
CATEGORIES:Workshops and Classes
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:UNC Chapel Hill
DTSTAMP:20260905T041912Z
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_53578118134571
DTSTART:20260825T180000Z
DTEND:20260825T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Introducing\, UNC Libraries’ AI platform\, PromptLab! PromptL
 ab is a user-friendly platform to interact with AI with no technical exper
 ience needed. You can use an assortment of open-source and cloud-based mod
 els\, all managed by UNC and protected with institutional data safeguards.
  This workshop will teach you how PromptLab can support your teaching\, le
 arning\, or work. Whether you’re an AI expert or an AI skeptic\, this wo
 rkshop will help you get started with PromptLab.\n\n \n\nFor more informat
 ion\, explore our PromptLab User Guide. \n\n \n\nThis workshop is offered 
 by the University Library and will be led by Gracie Riehm.  \n\n \n\nThis 
 workshop is being offered remotely via Zoom. Register here: https://calend
 ar.lib.unc.edu/event/17228711
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:Exploring Generative AI with PromptLab
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/exploring-generative-ai-with-p
 romptlab-8259
