DESCRIPTION:What is Hello CS? A welcome back celebration for all CS majors 
 and those interested in CS! Here are some of the areas you can explore:\n\
 nCareer (Sitterson Lower Lobby): Kickstart your career with the dedicated 
 UNC CS Career team by your side! Come and meet companies looking for great
  career talent like you.UNC CS Clubs (Sitterson\, Brooks and CSXL): UNC CS
  offers a vibrant and active population of undergraduate computer science 
 students at UNC\, and our student clubs allow for students with shared int
 erests to grow closer within the larger CS community. Come by and meet our
  club leaders. To learn more about our club community\, check out CS clubs
  hereUNC CS Advising (Sitterson Upper Lobby): Need some guidance regarding
  your academic path? Bring your questions and chat with UNC CS advisors.Un
 dergraduate Research (Sitterson Upper Lobby): Expand your horizons beyond 
 coursework with research opportunities. Come and meet undergraduate studen
 ts currently pursuing research and learn how they got started.
GEO:35.90988;-79.053221
