DESCRIPTION:Creating a project and data management plan is an essential com
 ponent of planning your research project. This online workshop will cover 
 the various phases of research for projects in the humanities and social s
 ciences\, creating a data management plan\, and long-term preservation of 
 your project and data. We will also include questions and considerations t
 o keep in mind\, such as technologies to use\, seeking funding\, publishin
 g platforms\, and more. By the end of the workshop\, attendees will be pre
 pared to begin planning their upcoming research project from research ques
 tion development to preservation.\n\n \n\nThis workshop is offered by the 
 University Libraries and will be led by librarians Rolando Rodriguez and M
 ichele Hayslett. \n\n \n\nThis workshop is being offered remotely via Zoom
 . Register here: https://calendar.lib.unc.edu/event/17229771
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:Managing Your Research: Project Planning and Data Management for th
 e Humanities and Social Sciences
