DESCRIPTION:On Thursday\, August 27\, celebrate the lunar eclipse with a sp
 ecial edition of Carolina Skies\, Morehead Planetarium's classic\, live st
 ar show!\n\n \n\nUnder the climate-controlled\, always-clear planetarium s
 ky\, we'll simulate the eclipse\, tour the North Carolina night sky\, and 
 take a spectacular journey through our universe. If the weather permits\, 
 join us after the show for eclipse observing from the Morehead Sundial. \n
 \n \n\nSCHEDULE\n\n9:30-10:30 PM — Carolina Skies: Lunar Eclipse show\n\
 n10:30-12:30 AM — FREE skywatching (weather permitting)\n\n \n\nUNC stud
 ents can enjoy CLE credit and $6 show tickets! Log in to Heel Life to rece
 ive the discount code.*\n\n \n\n*This discount is valid exclusively for on
 line sales from Saturday\, August 22\, through Thursday\, August 27. It of
 fers $10.95 off a college student ticket\, resulting in a final price of $
 6 plus tax. Please note that this discount is limited to one per order. We
  kindly request that you refrain from sharing this code\, as it is intende
 d for current UNC-Chapel Hill students only.
GEO:35.913753;-79.050409
LOCATION:Morehead Planetarium and Science Center
SUMMARY:Carolina Skies: Lunar Eclipse
