DESCRIPTION:The heat is on…and the science is cool!🔥\n\n \n\nScientist
 s are building tools to help people and the planet deal with hotter days. 
 In Morehead Planetarium's upcoming Saturday Science Sparks session\, join 
 members of UNC’s Data-Driven EnviroLab (DDL) for a fire hands-on experie
 nce around the challenge of a warmer climate!\n\n \n\nYou can meet members
  of DDL in the Launch Lab from 11 a.m. to 3 p.m. on Saturday\, August 29.\
 n\n \n\n🎟️ All ages are welcome. This special program is included wit
 h admission.\n\n \n\nABOUT SATURDAY SCIENCE SPARKS:\n\n \n\nMORE is happen
 ing at Morehead this year! New for 2026\, Saturday Science Sparks offers M
 orehead guests a closer encounter with current science. Covering topics li
 ke astronomy\, the physics of juggling\, and computer science\, this progr
 am collaborates with community partners and academic clubs\, bringing you 
 up-close experiences in the exciting world of STEAM. Saturday Science Spar
 ks is open to the public and included in admission.
GEO:35.913753;-79.050409
LOCATION:Morehead Planetarium and Science Center
SUMMARY:Saturday Science Sparks: Warmer Climates with the Data-Driven Envir
