DESCRIPTION:Mentor Morning is a casual\, high-impact networking experience 
 designed to connect entrepreneurs\, students\, and community members with 
 experienced mentors in an approachable and flexible format. During the eve
 nt\, multiple mentors will be available at individual tables while attende
 es rotate through the space to ask questions\, seek advice\, explore ideas
 \, and build connections. Rather than scheduling formal one-on-one meeting
 s\, participants can engage in shorter\, organic conversations with severa
 l mentors in a single visit. Hosted at The Innovate Carolina Junction in c
 ollaboration with Launch Chapel Hill\, community entrepreneurs\, coworking
  members\, and other attendees are encouraged to participate.
GEO:35.914361;-79.054904
LOCATION:Innovate Carolina Junction
SUMMARY:Mentor Morning
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/mentor-morning-181
