DESCRIPTION:The NC TraCS Biostatistics Seminar Series is appropriate for th
 ose with a basic familiarity with statistics. These seminars introduce top
 ics not often included in STATS 101.\n\n \n\nIn this seminar Yun Li\, PhD\
 , will discuss meta-analyses. Those interested may want to register for bo
 th this seminar and our subsequent presentation on systematic reviews\, bu
 t this seminar can also stand alone.\n\n \n\nRegister\n\n \n\nPlease note:
  This seminar will not be recorded and materials will be shared during the
  seminar or with documented attendees only. Attendance may be gathered fro
 m Zoom attendance reports.
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:NC TraCS Biostatistics Seminar Series: Meta-analysis
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/nc-tracs-biostatistics-seminar
 -series-meta-analysis
CATEGORIES:Workshops and Classes
END:VEVENT
