DESCRIPTION:Interested in the ever-evolving world of AI?\n\n \n\nJoin us fo
 r AI Unfiltered\, a monthly gathering where students\, faculty\, staff\, a
 nd community members come together over coffee to explore the fast-moving 
 world of artificial intelligence. Whether you're deeply involved in AI or 
 simply curious about the latest ideas\, this is a welcoming space to share
  insights\, ask questions\, network\, and connect through conversation abo
 ut all things AI.\n\n \n\nRegister here! Event is free and open to all.
GEO:35.914361;-79.054904
LOCATION:Innovate Carolina Junction\, Meantime Cafe
SUMMARY:AI Unfiltered: Coffee and Conversation
