DESCRIPTION:Each year\, scholars from across the nation visit Chapel Hill t
 o conduct research using the rare and historical materials at Wilson Speci
 al Collections Library. The Wilson Library Research Forum is an informal p
 rogram where you can hear from fellowship recipients firsthand and learn a
 bout their work with items from the special collections.\n\nIn this presen
 tation:\n\nAnna Blackburn (UNC)\n\nColonial Discourse in the British Carib
 bean: Travel Writing and Gothic Fiction\n\n \n\nEdward Yang (UNC)\n\nGothi
