UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_53578344493890
DTSTART:20260909T170000Z
DTEND:20260909T180000Z
DESCRIPTION:Ready to move beyond working with Generative AI chat models? Ag
 ents can help with specific tasks\, answer questions with a given knowledg
 e base\, and connect to tools. This workshop will cover best practices for
  creating agents on PromptLab\, the University Library’s privacy-focused
  AI platform. You will learn how to create effective agent instructions\, 
 upload knowledge sources\, connect agents with one another\, and more!\n\n
  \n\nNew to working with Generative AI? Check out our brief training video
 s.\n\n \n\nThis workshop is offered by the University Library and will be 
