  how to comply.\n\n \n\nGraduate students and post-docs from all disciplin
 es are welcome.\n\n \n\nThis workshop is offered by the UNC Health Science
 s Library through the Graduate School and led by Katherine Howell and Eliz
 abeth Moreton. It is part of the For Researchers workshop track\, and it w
 ill be held remotely via Zoom.
