BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:UNC Chapel Hill
DTSTAMP:20260905T041912Z
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_53698069060630
DTSTART:20260910T210000Z
DTEND:20260910T233000Z
DESCRIPTION:The Ackland welcomes back faculty\, students\, and staff to cam
 pus with a celebration for its newest installation in the ART& space\, Pha
 an Howng: Against Nature.  \nIn Against Nature\, artist Phaan Howng positi
 ons an ornate botanical composition above wainscotting that suggests the a
 rchitecture of a late nineteenth-century study or parlor. The paneling’s
  mint green tint evokes the green interior paints used in that period\, ac
 hieved through harmful additions of arsenic. Above the wainscotting\, pain
 ted vinyl banners depict a jungle of barely contained foliage with spikes 
 and fronds of neon reds\, electric oranges\, cerulean blues\, and bruised 
 purples. \nDuring the evening\, we will be celebrating with non-alcoholic 
 drinks and snacks. Phaan will be present during the evening to mingle with
  attendees. Around 6:15 PM\, she will briefly introduce the artwork and an
 swer any questions. \nJoin us for an evening honoring Phaan and welcoming 
 the installation to our community\, as well as starting off the semester i
 n a fun way! \nWe ask for folks to RSVP to give us a headcount for the eve
 nt. No ticket purchase is required.
GEO:35.912593;-79.054867
LOCATION:Ackland Art Museum
SUMMARY:Welcome Back to Campus: Reception for “Against Nature"
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/welcome-back-to-campus-recepti
 on-for-against-nature
CATEGORIES:Exhibits
END:VEVENT
