DESCRIPTION:Health professionals\, students\, and researchers often and uni
 ntentionally make health information and communication overly complex and 
 difficult to understand for patients and caregivers\, as well as those not
  in their field of study. This session will cover health literacy basics\,
  as well as some strategies\, resources\, and best practices in using plai
 n language to convey information by promoting and practicing clear written
  and verbal communication.\n\n \n\nThis workshop is offered by the UNC Hea
 lth Sciences Library and led by Terri Ottosen. It is part of the For Clini
 cians: Enhancing Practice Through Knowledge workshop track.
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:Clear Health Communication: Strategies and Best Practices in Writte
 n and Verbal Communication
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/clear-health-communication-str
 ategies-and-best-practices-in-written-and-verbal-communication-3015
CATEGORIES:Workshops and Classes
END:VEVENT
