DESCRIPTION:Are you prepared for an emergency with the supplies\, plans and
  skills needed to stay safe and help others?\n\n \n\nUnleash your superher
 o\, and join UNC Campus Safety for the Tar Heel Preparedness Festival on T
 uesday\, Sept. 15 from 11 a.m. to 2 p.m. in the Pit and Polk Place. Univer
 sity departments\, student organizations\, and local\, county\, and state 
 partners will share preparedness information\, provide interactive activit
 ies\, conduct live demonstrations\, and help you discover the skills and r
 esources needed to stay safe during an emergency.\n\n \n\nLevel up your pr
 eparedness superpowers by visiting booths\, completing challenges and lear
 ning practical safety skills that can help you respond confidently when it
  matters most. Whether you’re extinguishing a fire\, learning CPR or exp
 loring campus safety resources\, every stop helps you become a stronger pr
 eparedness hero.\n\n \n\nBe your own superhero. Prepare for anything!
LOCATION:The Pit
SUMMARY:Tar Heel Preparedness Festival
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/tar-heel-preparedness-festival
CATEGORIES:Exhibits
END:VEVENT
