DTSTART:20260915T160000Z
DTEND:20260915T180000Z
DESCRIPTION:The POP Lab is a drop-in workspace where UNC faculty and staff 
 can make progress with support from digital accessibility consultants. Bri
 ng your documents\, course materials\, websites\, reports\, or questions\,
  and work at your own pace. Come by for a few minutes or stay for the full
  session to ask questions\, explore tools\, solve problems and make meanin
 gful progress toward expanding access.\n\n \n\nProgress Over Perfection\n\
 nProgress means recognizing common barriers in the platforms you use and t
 aking small steps to reduce them. It’s choosing web formats over PDFs\, 
 applying table headers\, checking color contrast and collaborating on acce
 ssible templates so everyone can start from a strong foundation. Digital a
 ccessibility depends on steady\, intentional progress\, not perfection\, t
 o expand access for all.
LOCATION:Carolina Union\, 2502
SUMMARY:Digital Accessibility Pop-Up Labs
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/digital-accessibility-pop-up-l
 abs
CATEGORIES:Academic Calendar
END:VEVENT
