DESCRIPTION:Leveling Up with Databricks in the SHIRE\n\n \n\nNew developmen
 ts and guidance are coming to Databricks in the SHIRE. In this seminar\, J
 P Powers\, PhD\, will highlight new enhancements and functionality that wi
 ll become available to users\, with a particular focus on Unity Catalog. H
 e will also address some common pitfalls and points of confusion around wo
 rking with Databricks in the SHIRE.\n\n \n\nSpeaker:\nJP Powers\, PhD\nRes
 earch Data Scientist\nTraCS Data Science Lab\n\n \n\nRegister\n\n \n\nSemi
 nars in the NC TraCS Data Science Lab Seminar Series cover a range of topi
 cs related to health care data science\, clinical data\, data engineering\
 , and working in these areas at UNC-Chapel Hill. These hybrid seminars are
  usually held monthly on the third Tuesday of each month from 12:30-1:30 p
 .m. in the NC TraCS suite (room 219) on the 2nd floor of Brinkhous-Bullitt
  or via Zoom.
GEO:35.905771;-79.051242
LOCATION:Brinkhous-Bullitt Building\, 219
SUMMARY:TDSL Seminar: Leveling Up with Databricks in the SHIRE
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/tdsl-seminar-leveling-up-with-
 databricks-in-the-shire
CATEGORIES:Workshops and Classes
END:VEVENT
