DESCRIPTION:German Soul is a hybrid documentary in development from Grammy-
 winning musician and ethnobotanist Justin Robinson and filmmaker D. L. And
 erson (Vittles Films). Their new film investigates the persistent myths an
 d realities of soul food and Black southern foodways\, tracing the dishes 
 Robinson grew up with to their origins\, including the German and European
  roots long hidden within them. Brown bag lunch\; beverages provided.
GEO:35.915604;-79.048155
LOCATION:Love House\, Conference Room
SUMMARY:Thinking South: German Soul
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/thinking-south-german-soul
CATEGORIES:Workshops and Classes
