DESCRIPTION:We all have a role to play in promoting mental health and preve
 nting suicide. Whether you're a parent\, coach\, faith leader\, educator\,
  healthcare professional\, coworker\, friend\, or neighbor\, the right kno
 wledge and tools can help you recognize when someone may be struggling\, o
 ffer support\, and connect them to resources.\n\n \n\nThe Path to Preventi
 on is a community-centered summit and training event designed for individu
 als who want to build a stronger foundation in mental health and suicide p
 revention. Whether you're new to these topics or looking to better underst
 and how to recognize concerns and connect others with support\, this event
  will provide practical\, accessible knowledge and resources.
GEO:35.828784;-78.522603
LOCATION:Life Enrichment Center\, Raleigh NC
SUMMARY:The Path to Prevention: Foundations for Suicide Prevention
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/the-path-to-prevention-foundat
 ions-for-suicide-prevention
CATEGORIES:Meetings and Conferences
