DESCRIPTION:Financial goals are the specific long and short-term objectives
  to be attained through financial planning and management efforts. Among p
 ersonal financial goals are things such as: 1) financial security 2) trave
 l 3) education planning 4) retirement planning and 5) estate planning. Bei
 ng able to succeed in reaching these goals requires a plan with appropriat
 e milestones\, along with the ability to make adjustments along the way.
