DESCRIPTION:More and more funders are requiring data management plans as pa
 rt of grant funding applications.  Learning the basics of data management 
 now will help you enormously as you begin your graduate work and research 
 career.\n\nAfter this online workshop\, you will be able to:\n\nDescribe w
 hat data management is and why it’s important\, including relevant fundi
 ng agency policies for managing/sharing research data.List some strategies
  and tools for managing data\, both for personal and research purposes.Emp
 loy those strategies and tools to improve your data management practices.G
 raduate students and post-docs from all disciplines welcome.
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:Preparing for Career Success: Data Management (Graduate School Even
 t)
