 ut hazing prevention\, support and resources\, and ways to help create saf
 er and healthier student organization and member experiences.\n\n \n\nWhet
 her you're involved in a student organization or just want to learn more\,
  stop by to connect with campus partners\, pick up resources\, and explore
  how we can all contribute to a community where belonging never comes at t
 he expense of safety or well-being. It Takes All Heels to create a campus 
 where everyone feels like they belong. \n\n \n\nCLE credit available for u
 ndergraduate students – learn more on Heel Life. Any event updates will 
 be posted on the Violence Prevention and Advocacy Services events calendar
 .
