DESCRIPTION:Join UNC Global Affairs for Diplomacy Week 2026 to celebrate 25
 0 years of American diplomacy and the fifth anniversary of the Diplomacy I
 nitiative. This weeklong series takes place Monday\, Sept. 28\, through Fr
 iday\, Oct. 2\, and will bring diplomats and public servants to Chapel Hil
 l to celebrate the history of American diplomacy. Speakers bring experienc
 e and expertise in diplomacy\, intelligence\, the military and more.\n\n \
 n\nUNC Global Affairs is pleased to partner with the Association of Diplom
 atic Studies and Training to host the traveling exhibition on the history 
 of American diplomacy. The exhibition will be on display in the Florence a
 nd James Peacock Atrium in the FedEx Global Education Center from Monday t
 o Friday.\n\n \n\nVisit the Diplomacy Week 2026 webpage for a complete lis
 t of events.
GEO:35.907828;-79.054177
LOCATION:FedEx Global Education Center
SUMMARY:Diplomacy Week 2026
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/diplomacy-week-2026
CATEGORIES:Exhibits
CATEGORIES:Lectures
END:VEVENT
