DESCRIPTION:The 2024 NIH Public Access Policy includes several significant 
 changes from the previous policy\, and applies to all NIH-funded manuscrip
 ts accepted for publication on or after July 1\, 2025. Learn more about wh
 at has changed\, how to comply\, and what to expect going forward.\n\n \n\
 nThis workshop is offered by the UNC Health Sciences Library and the Schol
 arly Communications Office\, and led by Collin Drummond and Katherine Howe
 ll. It is part of the Grants and Compliance and Advancing Clinical Researc
 h Skills workshop tracks.
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:NIH Public Access Policy: What You Need to Know
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/nih-public-access-policy-what-
 you-need-to-know-3042
CATEGORIES:Workshops and Classes
END:VEVENT
