DESCRIPTION:The Stone Center’s Diaspora Festival of Black & Independent F
 ilm returns for another powerful celebration of cinema\, storytelling\, an
 d voices from across the African diaspora.\n\n \n\nSince 2004\, the festiv
 al has brought audiences together for compelling films\, engaging conversa
 tions\, and thought-provoking dialogue with filmmakers\, scholars\, and ou
 r community.\n\n \n\n✨ Headliner Film – Moving Masculinity by Esther A
 rmah\n📅 Thursday\, October 1st\n⏰ 6:30 p.m.\n📍 Sonja Haynes Stone 
 Center\n🎥 A must-see film\n💫 Free & open to all\n\n \n\nCome experie
 nce an unforgettable evening of film and conversation! We can’t wait to 
 see you there!\n\n \n\nRSVP: https://go.unc.edu/filmfest2026
