DESCRIPTION:This course will be offered over two mornings (9/30/2026 and 10
 /2/2026 from 10am – 2pm US Eastern) via Zoom only. Attendance is require
 d as the course will not be recorded.\n\nFocus groups are commonly used to
  capture rich information about attitudes and beliefs. This class will pre
 pare prospective students to organize and moderate focus groups. Students 
 will learn the most appropriate uses of focus groups\, how to segment and 
 recruit audiences\, how to develop a moderator’s guide\, and how to mode
 rate focus groups. The class will be supplemented with real-life examples 
 and hands-on exercises.\n\nRegistration and fee are required for Zoom link
  access.
