DESCRIPTION:The Interprofessional Design-a-thon at the Inpatient Rehabilita
 tion Center brings together student teams to apply human-centered design t
 hinking to address patient needs. Student teams collaborate on a solution 
 and present their idea to a panel of faculty and health professionals\, wh
 o then select a winning team. This is an approved IPEP Distinguished Schol
 ars Immersion hosted by the Office of Interprofessional Education and Prac
 tice.\n\n \n\nFall 2026 Design-a-thon:\n\nSaturday\, October 3 from 10 a.m
 . to 3 p.m.\n\nSaturday\, October 10 from 10 a.m. to 3 p.m.\n\n \n\nDesign
 -a-thon Eligibility:\n\nComplete basic BEAM Makerspace training.Be availab
 le all 5 hours on each Saturday (10 hours total) and complete independent 
 work (research\, faculty consultation\, etc.) in the week between.Designed
  for medical\, nursing\, biomedical engineering\, physical therapy\, clini
 cal rehabilitation and mental health counseling\, occupational therapy\, s
 peech therapy and pharmacy students. Other students can apply\, and their 
 participation will be considered as space allows.​Applications are revie
 wed as received and the deadline to apply is September 1\, 2026. Questions
 ? Email unc_ipe@unc.edu.
GEO:36.037842;-79.090807
