DESCRIPTION:The UNC Center for Media Law and Policy will celebrate First Am
 endment Day on Wednesday\, October 7\, 2026.\n \n\nThis campuswide\, daylo
 ng series of events is designed to both celebrate the First Amendment and 
 explore its role in the lives of Carolina students. Students and other mem
 bers of the University community will read from banned books and discuss t
 he public university’s special role as a marketplace of ideas and the ne
 ed to be tolerant when others exercise their rights. As always\, First Ame
 ndment Day is observed during National Banned Books Week.\n\n \n\nFirst Am
 endment Day is free and open to the public. For a full schedule of First A
 mendment Day events\, please visit FirstAmendmentDay.unc.edu. \n\n \n\nUNC
  students can register for CLE credit on Heel Life.
LOCATION:UNC-Chapel Hill
SUMMARY:First Amendment Day
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/first-amendment-day
CATEGORIES:Lectures
END:VEVENT
