DESCRIPTION:Do you want to get better at searching in PubMed? This workshop
  covers advanced topics in PubMed\, including expanded searching features\
 , MeSH terms\, and clinical queries. It is ideal for students\, faculty\, 
 or staff who already have some familiarity with PubMed and literature sear
 ching.\n\n \n\nThis workshop is offered by the UNC Health Sciences Library
  and led by Katherine Howell. It is part of the For Researchers\, For Clin
 icians: Enhancing Practice Through Knowledge\, and Advancing Clinical Rese
 arch Skills workshop tracks.
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:Advanced PubMed: Precision Searching for Health Sciences
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/advanced-pubmed-precision-sear
 ching-for-health-sciences-3883
