DESCRIPTION:2026 McColl Fellow Hooper Schultz will present on his dissertat
 ion project\, “Campus Queens\,” which uses oral histories and archival
  sources to examine the relationship between gay rights activism and highe
 r education in the 1970s at four public universities in the South. Brown b
 ag lunch\; beverages provided.
