DESCRIPTION:Are you seeking funding for your research and don't know where 
 to start? This workshop covers the basics of researching federal and non-f
 ederal funding opportunities using UNC resources such as InfoEdGlobal SPIN
  Plus. It is ideal for beginning researchers or those who want to diversif
 y their funding sources.\n\n \n\nThis workshop is offered by the UNC Healt
 h Sciences Library and led by Katherine Howell. It is part of the Grants a
 nd Compliance\, For Researchers\, and Advancing Clinical Research Skills w
 orkshop tracks.
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:Navigating Research Funding Resources
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/navigating-research-funding-re
 sources-7550
