DTSTART:20261021T140000Z
DTEND:20261021T160000Z
DESCRIPTION:Engagement in Research Nuts & Bolts: Specific Approaches for En
 gaging Patient & Community Partners in Research\n\n \n\nThere is no "one-s
 ize-fits-all" approach to engaging patient\, community\, or other partners
  in your research. Rather\, there are a variety of engagement methods to s
 uit your study's needs\, your research team's capacity\, and your partners
 ' interests.\n\n \n\nThis online training will describe three common appro
 aches for working with patient\, community\, and other partners in your re
 search: 1) consultative community feedback sessions\; 2) advisory boards\;
  and 3) sustained collaboration with partners as members of the research t
 eam.\n\n \n\nThe session will cover considerations for choosing these spec
 ific engagement methods\, as well as concrete processes and steps for impl
 ementing each approach. Participation in our Engagement in Research 101 tr
 aining is not required to attend this session\; however\, some knowledge o
 f engagement\, whether from prior training(s) or personal experience\, may
  foster deeper understanding of the material in this session.\n\n \n\nRegi
 ster\n\n \n\nPresenters:\nAlicia Bilheimer\, MPH - Director of Engaged Sci
 ence\, NC TraCS\nVeronica Carlisle\, MPH\, CHES - Senior Community Health 
 Educator\, UNC Lineberger Comprehensive Cancer Center (LCCC)\nNisha Datta\
 , MS - Senior Project Manager\, NC TraCS\nSimone Frank\, MPH - Senior Proj
 ect Manager\, NC TraCS\nJennifer Potter\, MPH\, CHES - Senior Program Coor
 dinator for Clinical Outreach\, LCCC\n\n \n\nEngaging Patient\, Community\
 , and Other Partners in Your Research is a multi-part online training seri
 es. You may register for the entire series OR any single training session.
  This training series was developed collaboratively with patient\, communi
 ty\, and researcher partners and is co-sponsored by the UNC Lineberger Com
 prehensive Cancer Center and NC TraCS Institute.
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:Engagement in Research Nuts & Bolts
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/engagement-in-research-nuts-bo
 lts
CATEGORIES:Workshops and Classes
END:VEVENT
