DESCRIPTION:If you're interested in mining newspaper content\, ProQuest TDM
  Studio has excellent tools for that. Come see this demo of how the softwa
 re can be used and learn more about all the content available through it. 
 Best of all\, ProQuest has already arranged the text mining rights for all
  of it so you can get started immediately!\n\n \n\nThis workshop is offere
 d by the University Library and will be led by librarians Michele Hayslett
  and Rolando Rodriguez.\n\n \n\nThis workshop is being offered remotely vi
 a Zoom. Register here: https://calendar.lib.unc.edu/event/17236664
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:Analyzing Newspaper Content on a Large Scale
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/analyzing-newspaper-content-on
 -a-large-scale-2954
CATEGORIES:Workshops and Classes
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:UNC Chapel Hill
DTSTAMP:20260905T041913Z
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_53753503567840
DTSTART:20261022T180000Z
DTEND:20261022T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Want to know how generative AI (GenAI) can be used to support y
 our research? This workshop covers various GenAI tools that have applicati
 ons for research tasks including tools that support writing manuscripts\, 
 exploring and summarizing literature (e.g.\, Research Rabbit\, Consensus\,
  and Undermind)\, performing data analysis (e.g.\, Julius and ProQuest TDM
  Studio)\, and conducting evidence syntheses (including systematic and sco
 ping reviews). An overview of library resources that support GenAI includi
 ng PromptLab and the Library AI Studio is also provided.\n\n \n\nThis work
 shop is intended for those with some existing knowledge of genAI. If you n
 eed more of an introduction to AI\, please check out the Library's other A
 I-related workshops.\n\n \n\nThis workshop is offered by the UNC Health Sc
 iences Library and led by Luke Barron. It is part of the For Researchers a
 nd Advancing Clinical Research Skills workshop tracks.
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:Leveraging Generative AI for Research Tasks (Research Week Event)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/leveraging-generative-ai-for-r
 esearch-tasks-research-week-event
CATEGORIES:Workshops and Classes
END:VEVENT
