DESCRIPTION:Violinist Alexi Kenney and pianist Janice Carissa invite audien
 ces to hear familiar works with fresh ears.\n\n \n\nAt the center of the p
 rogram is The Wild Yes by composer and violinist Michi Wiancko\, surrounde
 d by music that spans geography\, time\, and tradition. The musical voices
  of composers Sibelius\, Piazzolla\, and inti figgis-vizueta enter the con
 versation\, creating surprising relationships between sounds that might ot
 herwise seem worlds apart. \n\n \n\nKenney and Carissa guide audiences thr
 ough this remarkable musical landscape and remind us that great music is n
 ever fixed in time. Rather\, it is continually revitalized by new listener
 s and fresh perspectives.\n\n \n\nStudent tickets always $11. Eligible for
  CLE. Find out more and buy tickets at: https://carolinaperformingarts.org
 /events/alexi-kenney-janice-carissa/
LOCATION:Hill Hall\, Moeser Auditorium
SUMMARY:Alexi Kenney\, violin | Janice Carissa\, piano
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/alexi-kenney-violin-janice-car
 issa-piano
CATEGORIES:Performances
