DESCRIPTION:NAACP Legal Defense Fund (LDF) archivists and SOHP oral histori
 ans and project leaders will explore freedom as an ongoing and active purs
 uit. Hear audio clips from the LDF Oral History Project\, describing LDF
 ’s long history of defending rights and freedoms.\n\n \n\nThis event is 
 part of the history department’s America250@Carolina programming
