 o a variety of tools that you may use. This workshop emphasizes thoughtful
  and ethical use of AI tools with a focus on transparency\, privacy\, and 
 human oversight.\n\n \n\nThis workshop is offered by the University Librar
 y and will be led by librarian Rolando Rodriguez. \n\n \n\nThis workshop i
