DESCRIPTION:Gen AI tools have the potential to take on tedious tasks and da
 ily drudge work\, freeing us up for the fun parts: thinking\, dreaming\, a
 nd doing. In this workshop led by library staff\, learn practical promptin
 g techniques that can turn mile-long to-do lists into actionable plans\, h
 elping you work smarter across all areas of your life.\n\nWe will also cro
 wd-source tips from attendees on how Gen AI tools have helped them organiz
 e tasks for work\, school\, and home life. \n\nAttendees will: \n\nPractic
 e crafting clear prompts to create plans for time management\, prioritizin
 g work or study tasks\, travel\, cleaning\, meal planning\, and more.Under
 stand how to use AI tools effectively. Share ideas for using Gen AI tools 
 to create routines\, manage tasks\, develop study guides\, and save time a
 t work and home.This workshop is offered by the University Libraries and w
 ill be led by librarian Dayna Durbin.\n\n \n\nThis workshop is being offer
 ed remotely via Zoom only. You can register through the library calendar. 
 Registrants will receive a Zoom link\; those on the waitlist will not rece
 ive a Zoom link unless they are bumped up to a registered spot.\n\n\nAll r
 egistrants however\, will receive access to the meeting recording and reso
 urces.
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:GenAI Life Hacks
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/genai-life-hacks-2513
CATEGORIES:Workshops and Classes
END:VEVENT
