DESCRIPTION:Has it been a while since you last used statistics? Are you eag
 er to brush up on some of the basics?\n\nThis short course is designed to 
 review basic statistical concepts beginning with statistical approaches us
 ed to describe the data and concluding with regression analysis.\n\nStatis
 tical concepts will be demonstrated using hands-on examples that replicate
  analyses from published papers. Registration and fee required for Zoom li
 nk access.
