DESCRIPTION:This masterclass will explore how strategy is different in a fa
 mily enterprise. Topics include how owner goals affect the strategy and gr
 owth trajectory of the business\, the importance of strategic thinking in 
 creating competitive advantage\, and the critical role organizational cult
 ure plays in the execution of strategy. Several examples of family firms w
 ith clear strategies will be discussed to demonstrate key principles of ef
 fective strategic planning.
LOCATION:
