DESCRIPTION:Design of observational studies for public health\n\n \n\nThe N
 C TraCS Biostatistics Seminar Series is appropriate for those with a basic
  familiarity with statistics. These seminars introduce topics not often in
 cluded in STATS 101.\n\n \n\nIn this seminar Beibo Zhao\, PhD\, will discu
 ss the different kinds of observational designs that can be used for publi
 c health research\, and their pros and cons.\n\n \n\nRegister\n\n \n\nPlea
 se note: This seminar will not be recorded and materials will be shared du
 ring the seminar or with documented attendees only. Attendance may be gath
 ered from Zoom attendance reports.
