DESCRIPTION:FEATURING\n\nVictor Rosenbaum\, piano\n\n \n\nPROGRAM\n\n“LAS
 T WORDS\, LAST WORKS: The Final Solo Piano Pieces of Beethoven\, Brahms\, 
 and Schubert”\n\nLudwig van Beethoven  Six Bagatelles\, Opus 126\nJohann
