DESCRIPTION:To be in the room when Yo-Yo Ma and Emanuel Ax perform together
  is to witness a musical relationship shaped by more than four decades of 
 friendship\, trust\, and curiosity. Ax has described their collaboration a
 s one in which the music leads and the musicians follow. Their performance
 s carry an ease and intimacy that only comes from years of listening close
 ly to one another\, responding in the moment\, and returning again and aga
 in to the joy of making music together.\n\n \n\nWhat makes this collaborat
 ion remarkable is not simply technical mastery. It is the sense of connect
 ion that runs through every note. Audiences can hear it in the way one mus
 ician follows the other’s lead\, anticipates a phrase\, or finds space f
 or an unexpected idea to emerge.\n\n \n\nBoth artists are familiar faces a
 t Carolina Performing Arts\; Ma through multiple appearances with the Silk
 road Ensemble and Ax through recitals and orchestral performances. Experie
 ncing them together offers a rare opportunity to witness two lifelong frie
 nds in conversation through music.\n\n \n\nStudent tickets always $11. Eli
 gible for CLE. Find out more and buy tickets at: https://carolinaperformin
 garts.org/events/emanuelax-yoyoma/
GEO:35.911208;-79.051989
LOCATION:Memorial Hall
SUMMARY:Emanuel Ax\, piano & Yo-Yo Ma\, cello
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/emanuel-ax-piano-yo-yo-ma-cell
 o
CATEGORIES:Performances
END:VEVENT
